<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-047" chapter-id="c-songshu-047-shilun" source-id="s-songshu-047-shilun-ws2190557">
  <p id="c-songshu-047-shilun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：<persName id="c-songshu-047-shilun:p001:m0004" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">劉敬宣</persName>與高祖恩結龍潛，義分早合，雖興復之始，事隔逢迎，而深期久要，未之或爽。隆赫之任，義止於人存，飾終之數，無聞於身後，恩禮之有厚薄者，將有以乎。</p>
</text>
